Program overview
A small project that base your small local data you give it to answer your question 
like a mini RAG project 😁

Problem i encountered 
Didn't know what to write as value to the key "prompt" in the dictionary "data"

So i wrote something like :

data ={
    "model":"llama3.2",
    "prompt":user_input + knowledge_text,
    "stream": False

}
which made ollama answer in it own way and made it not to answer base on my local data and i said my definition are not hitting the point

Solution and what I learnt 
I found out that i had to create a prompt telling it what i actually want it to do 
so i crate a variable also called prompt used f string and i wrote my prompt in it and give the key "prompt" a variable "prompt which contains my entire prompt the the code change to this:

prompt = f"""
Answer question based of the context been given , and lightly polish answer without adding too much info
context={knowledge_text}
Question={user_input}
Answer:"""  

data ={
    "model": "llama3.2",
    "prompt":prompt,
    "stream":False
} 